From: Anland Hyprland Maintainers <anland@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 7 Aug 2026 13:00:00 +0800
Subject: core: add Anland backend selection and clipboard relay
Add Anland backend selection logic (AQ_BACKEND_ANLAND mandatory + HEADLESS fallback),
CAnlandClipboardSource class for non-blocking poll-based clipboard relay,
and --anland CLI flag.
