+    // ── Anland clipboard relay ─────────────────────────────────────
+    // Bidirectional clipboard sync between Linux Wayland apps and the
+    // Android consumer, mirroring KWin's AnlandBackend clipboard handling.
+    // NOTE: g_pSeatManager is not yet initialized at this stage.
